# "This creature gets +1/+1 for each creature you control and each creature card in your graveyard": a 0/0 alone it is 1/1 (itself); with Ornithopter beside it 2/2; once Lightning Bolt kills
# the Ornithopter the creature card in the graveyard counts in its place, still 2/2, while the Black Lotus there (an artifact) does not. Bot2's Memnite on the battlefield and
# the Memnite in Bot2's graveyard (its own second Bolt) are not Bot1's, and count for nothing.

